ck's floorboard while  this is happening miguel takes control  of the truck and drives away when we  learn that montecino is still  alive he calls for help and takes  miguel's truck to chase after them  where he finds pictures of a young girl  and a newspaper clipping that says  police resume search for the body of  soul dad garcia so miguel  obviously has something to do with this  young girl montecino catches up to the  truck and tries doing his best mad max  but ends up crashing into a tree  miguel slams the break which causes rey  who was underneath the floorboards  trying to escape at the time to be  impaled on a screw  so miguel is like i can't get these guys  out they can't get themselves out and i  could get caught so let's set this truck  in the middle of a frozen lake  and to make sure no one gets away he'll  shoot around the ice so the truck falls  to the icy bottom  and the guys inside aren't too keen on  this idea  martin says there's actually a secret  exit to the truck  way to bring that up now martin it's  located above the fluorescent light  along the roof meanwhile  nano is like i screw you guys i'm going  home  and ramis helps martin undo his cuffs  and they barely make it out alive now  miguel thinking he's killed everyone  notices that nano made it out so he goes  on one final hunt which is the last act  of the film and when remiss and martin  get out we start to see how martin's  character arc  is changing remiss asks him what now is  martin going to let him free  remiss could have left him chained up  down there but risked his own life to  save him  so martin lets him go asking him what  he's going to call his restaurant he's  dreamed about opening martin has always  been a rule follower so we start to see  here how he's beginning to change  martin hears gunshots and rushes towards  them at this point he's trying to stop  miguel from killing nano but we still  don't really know why miguel is going  through  all these lengths to get at him that